{"id": "86320", "name": "Function_Implicit_1", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>Use implicit differentiation to find  \\[\\frac{dy}{dx}\\] <br />for the graph of  \\[x^{{CT:0}}+y^{{CT:1}}={{CT:2}}xy\\]</p>\n<p> [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>To find \\[\\frac{dy}{dx}\\]</p>\n<p>for the graph of \\[x^{{CT:0}}+y^{{CT:1}}={{CT:2}}xy\\]<br />rearrange the equation to give</p>\n<p>\\[x^{{CT:0}}+y^{{CT:1}}-{{CT:2}}xy =0\\]</p>\n<p>Thus</p>\n<p>\\[\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(x^{{CT:0}}+y^{{CT:1}}-{{CT:2}}xy\\right) =0\\]</p>\n<p>\\[{{CT:0}}{{CT:3}}+{{CT:1}}{{CT:4}}\\frac{dy}{dx}-{{CT:2}}(y+x\\frac{dy}{dx})=0\\]</p>\n<p>\\[\\frac{dy}{dx}({{CT:1}}{{CT:4}}-{{CT:2}}x) = {{CT:2}}y-{{CT:0}}{{CT:3}}\\]</p>\n<p>\\[\\frac{dy}{dx} = \\frac{{{CT:2}}y-{{CT:0}}{{CT:3}}}{{{CT:1}}{{CT:4}}-{{CT:2}}x}\\] </p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "diff", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Diff", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote"